WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: es

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:10.256
Best documentary in 2021 Montréal International
First Peoples’ Festival (Présence Autochtone)

00:00:10.516 --> 00:00:12.569
Documentary in Construction Prize
of the Ministry of Culture of Peru

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:18.387
CUSCO, PERU

00:00:37.788 --> 00:00:40.840
He put me in the center of his words

00:00:41.099 --> 00:00:42.281
so to enchant me, right?

00:00:47.582 --> 00:00:50.895
The legendary, and ultimately forgotten

00:00:50.906 --> 00:00:52.416
Art of Hunting

00:00:52.476 --> 00:00:54.916
originally was an exclusively

00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:58.994
male privilege and duty.

00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:01.708
The "bricheros" aspire to seduce

00:01:02.153 --> 00:01:03.731
Western tourists,

00:01:03.731 --> 00:01:05.277
to obtain an economic, 

00:01:05.277 --> 00:01:07.569
material or symbolic benefit.

00:01:08.365 --> 00:01:12.305
This Art requires patience above all.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:13.895
In addition to this quality

00:01:13.895 --> 00:01:16.513
it requires fundamental observation.

00:01:21.173 --> 00:01:23.083
This is mainly to get into

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.007
the head of the prey,

00:01:25.007 --> 00:01:26.473
feeling her flesh,

00:01:26.473 --> 00:01:28.204
feeling her heartbeat,

00:01:28.204 --> 00:01:30.115
to anticipate her moves,

00:01:30.115 --> 00:01:32.002
to know where she comes from 

00:01:32.002 --> 00:01:32.928
and where she goes.

00:01:33.397 --> 00:01:35.464
It is dangerous what he is thinking,

00:01:35.464 --> 00:01:36.835
what he is teaching.

00:01:36.955 --> 00:01:38.145
And in this way,

00:01:38.145 --> 00:01:39.371
prepare the ritual,

00:01:39.671 --> 00:01:41.498
which from the beginning of time

00:01:41.498 --> 00:01:43.938
has always been the same

00:01:43.938 --> 00:01:47.496
to get to nail the final bite

00:01:47.869 --> 00:01:50.145
in the very center of her heart.

00:01:50.261 --> 00:01:54.094
DAMNED WOMANIZER

00:01:54.780 --> 00:01:57.243
A documentary by Roberto de la Puente

